*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_subtract_from_two_targets
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 GROUP-X.
   05 BALANCE PIC 9(5) VALUE 1000.
01 GROUP-Y.
   05 BALANCE PIC 9(5) VALUE 2000.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    SUBTRACT 100 FROM BALANCE OF GROUP-X.
    SUBTRACT 500 FROM BALANCE OF GROUP-Y.
    DISPLAY BALANCE OF GROUP-X.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING BALANCE DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE GROUP-X DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "00900"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [00900] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY BALANCE OF GROUP-Y.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING BALANCE DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE GROUP-Y DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "01500"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [01500] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

